===Etymology===
From {{etyl|de|en}} {{term|frankfurter||lang=de}}, the adjectival form of {{term|Frankfurt||lang=de}}. Specifically, a reference to {{term|Frankfurt-am-Main|lang=en}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{UK|US|Canada}} A moist [[sausage]] of soft, even texture and flavor, often made from mechanically recovered meat or meat slurry.

